  "description": "MicroserviceMonolith is a comprehensive, production-ready modular monolith framework for .NET. It features decoupled modules with lifecycle management, in-memory command and query buses (CQRS), event bus with flexible dispatch strategies, pipeline behaviors (logging, retry, error handling, performance tracking), background execution channels, transactional outbox pattern, and full Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration.",
